
### Export Batch Summary
POST http://localhost:9000
Content-Type: application/json
version: 1
tallyrequest: Export
type: Data
id: Batch

{
  "static_variables": [
    {
      "name": "svExportFormat",
      "value": "jsonex"
    },
    {
      "name": "svCurrentCompany",
      "value": "mani9"
    },
    {
      "name": "EXPLODEFLAG",
      "value": "Yes"
    }
  ]
}
